        {
            "id": 1,
            "module": "ai-local-agent:RunLocalAIAgent",
            "version": 0,
            "parameters": {
                "makeConnectionId": null
            },
            "mapper": {
                "files": [],
                "message": "{{12.fullTextAnnotation.text}}",
                "threadId": "",
                "outputType": "text",
                "tokenLimit": "50",
                "modelConfig": {
                    "timeout": "",
                    "recursionLimit": "300",
                    "iterationsFromHistoryCount": "10"
                },
                "defaultModel": "global.anthropic.claude-sonnet-5",
                "systemPrompt": "You are a contract review agent. Your goal: extract key contract metadata, identify clauses, assess their risk level, and produce a structured risk report from the contract text provided in the input.\r\n\r\nDo not generate a PDF, file, or any downloadable output. Never call generate_file_output or deliver_files_to_user under any circumstance. Your entire response must be exactly the raw JSON object described below, and nothing else — no summary, no file, no additional text before or after it.\r\n\r\nStep 1 — Extract contract metadata:\r\n- title: the contract's title\r\n- contract_id: the contract identification code or number, if present\r\n- parties: list of parties, each with name and reference_name (the short name used to refer to them in the contract, e.g. \"Zestro\" for \"Zestro Group\")\r\n- effective_date: when the contract starts to be in effect\r\n- expiration_date: when the contract ends, if stated\r\n\r\nStep 2 — Scan the contract text for these clause categories only (only include a category if it is actually present): Termination, Auto-renewal, Payment terms, Liability, Indemnification, Confidentiality, Governing law, Unusual or non-standard clauses.\r\n\r\nStep 3 — For each clause found, determine: category, a plain-language finding (one sentence), a risk_level (Low, Medium, or High), and a concrete recommendation (one sentence).\r\n\r\nStep 4 — Compute an overall_risk_score (Low, Medium, or High) based on the aggregate of all findings, not simply the count of High items — one High-risk unlimited liability clause can outweigh several Low items.\r\n\r\nStep 5 — Write a 2-3 sentence executive_summary of the contract's main risk areas.\r\n\r\nStep 6 — In addition to the structured clauses array, also produce a field called clauses_text: a single plain-text string containing all clauses formatted as \"Category: [category]\\nRisk Level: [risk_level]\\nFinding: [finding]\\nRecommendation: [recommendation]\", with a blank line between each clause.\r\n\r\nRisk calibration rules (strict):\r\n- \"High\" is reserved for clauses creating material financial exposure, unlimited liability, one-sided termination rights, or clear deviation from standard market practice.\r\n- \"Medium\" is for clauses worth negotiating but within normal commercial range.\r\n- \"Low\" is for standard, balanced, or boilerplate clauses needing no action.\r\n- Do not default to High or Medium just because a clause exists. A fair, standard clause is Low even in a sensitive category like liability.\r\n- Never invent a clause category or metadata field not present in the contract. If a metadata field (contract_id, effective_date, expiration_date) is not explicitly stated in the contract text, set its value to exactly \"Not present\" — do not leave it as an empty string, and do not describe or infer a value from other clauses (e.g. do not compute an expiration date from a term length).\r\n- When assessing risk, prioritize the thresholds defined in the negotiation playbook provided in your knowledge, if one is available, over generic market-standard assumptions. If no playbook is available, or it does not cover a clause type, fall back to general market-standard reasoning.\r\n\r\nReturn your final result as the following raw JSON object. Never wrap it in markdown code blocks or backticks.\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"title\": \"string\",\r\n  \"contract_id\": \"string\",\r\n  \"parties\": [\r\n    { \"name\": \"string\", \"reference_name\": \"string\" }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"effective_date\": \"string\",\r\n  \"expiration_date\": \"string\",\r\n  \"overall_risk_score\": \"Low | Medium | High\",\r\n  \"executive_summary\": \"string\",\r\n  \"clauses\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"category\": \"string\",\r\n      \"risk_level\": \"Low | Medium | High\",\r\n      \"finding\": \"string\",\r\n      \"recommendation\": \"string\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"clauses_text\": \"string\"\r\n}",
                "promptCaching": "none",
                "fallbackEnabled": false,
                "reasoningEffort": "low"
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 900,
                    "y": 0
                },
                "restore": {
                    "expect": {
                        "files": {
                            "mode": "chose"
                        },
                        "outputType": {
                            "label": "Text"
                        },
                        "defaultModel": {
                            "mode": "chose",
                            "label": "Claude Sonnet 5 (Paid plans only)Frontier model for complex reasoning, advanced agents, and coding"
                        },
                        "promptCaching": {
                            "mode": "chose",
                            "label": "Off"
                        },
                        "reasoningEffort": {
                            "mode": "chose",
                            "label": "Low"
                        }
                    },
                    "parameters": {
                        "makeConnectionId": {
                            "data": {
                                "scoped": "true",
                                "connection": "ai-provider"
                            },
                            "label": "My Make's AI Provider connection"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "makeConnectionId",
                        "type": "account:ai-provider,openai-gpt-3,anthropic-claude,gemini-ai-q9zyjp,ai-agent-foundry-openai,ai-agent-foundry-non-openai,mistral-ai,cohere,groq,ai-agent-xai,amazon-bedrock,ai-agent-openai-compatible",
                        "label": "Connection",
                        "required": true
                    }
                ],
                "expect": [
                    {
                        "name": "defaultModel",
                        "type": "select",
                        "label": "Model",
                        "required": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "reasoningEffort",
                        "type": "select",
                        "label": "Reasoning effort",
                        "validate": {
                            "enum": [
                                "low",
                                "medium",
                                "high"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "tokenLimit",
                        "type": "number",
                        "label": "Maximum output length (%)",
                        "validate": {
                            "max": 100,
                            "min": 20
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "promptCaching",
                        "type": "select",
                        "label": "Prompt caching",
                        "validate": {
                            "enum": [
                                "none",
                                "5m",
                                "1h"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "fallbackEnabled",
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "label": "Enable fallback connection",
                        "required": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "systemPrompt",
                        "type": "text",
                        "label": "Instructions"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "message",
                        "type": "text",
                        "label": "Input",
                        "required": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "files",
                        "spec": [
                            {
                                "name": "fileName",
                                "type": "filename",
                                "label": "File name",
                                "semantic": "file:name"
                            },
                            {
                                "name": "data",
                                "type": "buffer",
                                "label": "Data",
                                "semantic": "file:data"
                            }
                        ],
                        "type": "array",
                        "label": "Input files"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "threadId",
                        "type": "text",
                        "label": "Conversation ID",
                        "validate": {
                            "max": 256
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "modelConfig",
                        "spec": [
                            {
                                "name": "recursionLimit",
                                "type": "number",
                                "label": "Steps per agent call"
                            },
                            {
                                "name": "iterationsFromHistoryCount",
                                "type": "number",
                                "label": "Maximum conversation history"
                            },
                            {
                                "name": "timeout",
                                "type": "number",
                                "label": "Step timeout",
                                "validate": {
                                    "max": 600,
                                    "min": 120
                                }
                            }
                        ],
                        "type": "collection",
                        "label": "Model configuration"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "outputType",
                        "type": "select",
                        "label": "Response format",
                        "required": true,
                        "validate": {
                            "enum": [
                                "text",
                                "make-schema",
                                "udt-schema"
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "tools": [
                {
                    "name": "Agent knowledge",
                    "description": "Search uploaded files using semantic similarity to retrieve relevant facts and context needed to answer the user’s question. Use this tool when the answer depends on information contained in the uploaded documents.",
                    "flow": [
                        {
                            "id": 13,
                            "module": "knowledge:KnowledgeStandAlone",
                            "version": 1,
                            "parameters": {},
                            "mapper": {
                                "limit": "50",
                                "query": "{{1.query}}",
                                "fileIds": [],
                                "filestorage": [
                                    "YOUR_FILE_STORAGE_ID"
                                ]
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 1167,
                                    "y": 272
                                },
                                "restore": {
                                    "expect": {
                                        "query": {
                                            "extra": {
                                                "aiHelp": "A concise natural-language description of the information to look for. The query is embedded and matched by semantic similarity (cosine distance), so it should express intent and meaning, not exact phrasing, keywords, or technical instructions."
                                            }
                                        }
                                    }
                                },
                                "expect": [
                                    {
                                        "name": "filestorage",
                                        "type": "filestorage",
                                        "label": "Knowledge files"
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "name": "query",
                                        "type": "text",
                                        "label": "Search query",
                                        "required": true
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "name": "fileIds",
                                        "type": "hidden",
                                        "required": true
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "name": "limit",
                                        "type": "number",
                                        "label": "Limit",
                                        "required": true,
                                        "validate": {
                                            "max": 100,
                                            "min": 1
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
